      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Printing multiple values\n",
        "\n",
        "Several values can be passed to the `print()` function:"
      ],
      "id": "5ee5f27b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "print(\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\")"
