      "id": "889881f2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## The `sep` argument\n",
        "\n",
        "The optional `sep` argument specifies the separator placed between multiple\n",
        "values.\n",
        "\n",
        "By default, the separator is a single space."
      ],
      "id": "11c8221d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "print(\"One\", \"Two\", \"Three\")"
      ],
      "id": "948e7404",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "A different separator can be specified:"
      ],
      "id": "2d0ce2db"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "print(\"One\", \"Two\", \"Three\", sep=\"-\")"
