      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## The `end` argument\n",
        "\n",
        "By default, the `print()` function ends its output with a new line.\n",
        "\n",
        "The optional `end` argument can change this behaviour."
      ],
      "id": "21b58086"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "print(\"One\", \"Two\", sep=\" \", end=\" \")\n",
