      "id": "a7df422c",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "In this example, the second `print()` call continues on the same line.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Escape sequences\n",
        "\n",
        "An **escape sequence** represents a special character inside a string.\n",
        "\n",
        "Some commonly used escape sequences are:\n",
        "\n",
        "| Escape sequence | Meaning |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| `\\n` | new line |\n",
        "| `\\t` | horizontal tab |\n",
        "| `\\r` | carriage return |\n",
        "\n",
        "### New line"
      ],
      "id": "6d357008"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "print(\"Monday\\nTuesday\\nWednesday\")"
      ],
      "id": "2a89f7c2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Tab"
      ],
      "id": "886e6bad"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "print(\"Name\\tScore\")\n",
        "print(\"Anna\\t85\")\n",
        "print(\"John\\t92\")"
